%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Thresher
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 14
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Wrecking Ball
    AbilityDescription: 'The ball itself - PASSIVE, always destructive, and its destruction is binary. Below smash speed it wears your DOMAIN colour, destroys rival prisms it touches and BOUNCES off your own domain''s; at smash speed it turns RED, destroys every prism it hits (yours included) and every hit sets off an explosion. The ball and the chain also reach ENEMY VESSELS: each contact is a scored Strike that STEALS petals (the PvP-is-petals-only rule). Charge scales how many: ThresherConfigSO.vesselHitPetals, 1 petal per element at rest -> 3 at level 10 (floor 0.5).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Magnet
    UpgradeDescription: 'The free ball is drawn toward the nearest enemy vessel within magnetRange (150 u) at magnetAcceleration (220 u/s^2) - it moves only your ball, never the other vessel. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Charge) in ThresherExecutor (MagnetActive -> PullBallToEnemy).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Mass Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'The A button TOGGLES Mass Mode: the ball builds instead of breaking. It STEALS the rival prisms it touches, SHIELDS your own, lays a trail of your prisms behind it and never explodes - and the energy the chain''s kills bank keeps building instead of being spent, so leaving Mass Mode makes the next rival hit a bigger blast. Mass scales the SIZE of the trail prisms the ball lays: ThresherConfigSO.massTrailScale on every axis of massTrailPrismScale, x1 at rest -> x2 at level 10 (floor x0.5).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Armoured Trail
    UpgradeDescription: 'The prisms the ball lays in Mass Mode are laid SHIELDED (per-lay snapshot). Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Mass) in ThresherExecutor.LayTrailPrism (ArmouredTrailActive).'
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Winch
    AbilityDescription: 'The RIGHT trigger is the chain''s RIGIDITY (analog): released, the chain is a slack bungee the turns and the spin carry the ball out on; pulled, it is rigid. Tightening reels the ball in and spins it up - the crack - and the chain eases to lime when a tighten now would crack it past smash speed. The chain, taut or slack, SLICES rival prisms it touches and SHIELDS your own; each kill banks energy for the ball''s next explosion (the Space card shows how much radius is banked). Space scales the LARGEST explosion the bank can buy: ThresherConfigSO.energyMaxDiameterScale, x4 diameter at rest -> x8 at level 10 (floor x2).'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Breaker
    UpgradeDescription: 'A RED (smash-speed) ball''s direct hit destroys super-shielded prisms, through the sanctioned DeactivateShields -> Damage(devastate) sequence. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Space) in ThresherExecutor.SweepBall (BreakerActive). (Until 2026-10-13 Space 5 was Reaper Chain.)'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Plant
    AbilityDescription: 'The LEFT trigger is a BRAKE (analog): a partial pull slows the ball and swings you round it like a sliding anchor; only a FULL pull stops it, smoothly, and makes it the pivot you orbit, faster every lap (pull RT to wind in and spin faster). With both triggers at a full pull the camera hands over to the launch view: the sticks pick a launch point on the circle and easing LT off launches from it, through the crosshair, as the ship comes round - always boosted (launchBoost x4.8), whatever the timing. Your hull lays no trail while the crosshair is up. Time scales how fast the spin winds up to launch speed: ThresherConfigSO.spinMultiplier on the spin-up rate AND its cap, x1 at rest -> x1.75 at level 10 (floor x0.5).'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 'OPEN since 2026-10-13 (design needed). Time 5 was "Perfect Release" (a launch timed inside a 0.25 s window left x1.6 faster); it retired when EVERY aimed launch out of the crosshair view took the boost (ThresherConfigSO.launchBoost, x4.8) - the crosshair move is rewarded, not the timing. No IsUpgradeActive(Time) gate remains.'
  omniAbilityLabel: windmills the ball round the ship
